+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-10-15-prompt-request-fingerprint
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-15-prompt-request-fingerprint.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds an optional caller-computed request fingerprint to persisted user-rpc message sources.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-15-prompt-request-fingerprint
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "acb943adbfcc13378aecd2b0c1915313d3fa8ac36fa9611fb62fdd8a33a35846"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "0c7515c1f3710ed86621151edd335f326b1df14ddda30a6875141e106cfec791"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "3ef1751a9c1bce3a7d76cf6f31b836a3447e2d24a2b9c4edf08d1fa7023eafee"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-21-user-question-reply"
+    after: "bb939a835785fa12e4cf7b7900eaa0fe5a3bea99df4720625588a0d15a28f4be"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+The field is optional, so existing inbox and user-message records remain readable without rewriting. Prompt retries compare the fingerprint, including absence, against the accepted source; a mismatch is rejected without admitting another message. The fingerprint records request identity, not model-visible content.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+pnpm exec vitest run packages/api/session-controller/tests/commands-upload-file.host.spec.ts: 28 tests passed, covering queued, claimed, canceled and reconstructed requests, concurrent admission, and legacy messages without fingerprints.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
